WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
in Michigan a car chase right out of&nbsp;
a Hollywood movie a ten-year-old boy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.760
stole his mother's car and took it on&nbsp;
a highway leading police on a car chase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:13.860
authorities say the child took the car from&nbsp;
a relative's home where he was staying when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:19.500
officers tried to pull the car over the young&nbsp;
driver wouldn't stop so the OnStar navigation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.080
service was used to disable the vehicle it hit&nbsp;
a guardrail before coming to a complete stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:30.180
the boy attempted to flee the scene but&nbsp;
was apprehended and later arraigned the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.380
ten-year-old told police that he took the car&nbsp;
because he wanted to visit his mum in Detroit

